              "message": "docs: say which whisper entry records what, and drop the delivery claims in example 06\n\n- profiles/whisper.md section 4: the whisper.ask entry records who asked\n  whom, when and the deadline; the lapse notification records that no\n  answer arrived before the lapse check ran and the default applied.\n  Neither shows whether anyone was notified. Points at SPECIFICATION\n  15.1, item 10, for delivery.\n- examples/06-whisper-prompt.md: the Coordinator records the whisper and\n  leaves delivery to the deployment, and the first lapse check after the\n  deadline records the lapse, with no assumption that Alice was away.\n- chap-analytics: the whispers brief and chart say what to check in plain\n  words, and the example report and the walkthrough output carry the\n  same text.",
